What will be the output of the following code?

```java
int a = 5, b = 10;
if (a++ > 5) {
    if (b-- > 10) {
        System.out.println("X");
    } else {
        System.out.println("Y");
    }
} else {
    if (++b > 10) {
        System.out.println("Z");
    } else {
        System.out.println("W");
    }
}
System.out.println("a: " + a + ", b: " + b);
```

A. X, a: 6, b: 9  
B. Y, a: 6, b: 9  
C. Z, a: 6, b: 10  
D. W, a: 6, b: 11

